    registry statement file can carry the proposition without naming 280 island
    modules.  The binders ARE the Arb trust boundary: every `RHInBoxT_*` module
    CONSUMES interval-arithmetic data (`hLine`, `hArbT`) and nothing discharges it
    in-kernel.  The kernel certifies the COMPOSITION only.  Emitted by campaign.py
    (`emit_indexed_capstone`); DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.  This is a FINITE verification
    to a finite height, NOT a proof of RH.  conjecture1_proved = False. -/
