    `[segLo k i, segHi k i]` contains no off-line zero in the strip box.  These
    are the Arb-class inputs of the `RHInBoxT_*` modules; NOTHING discharges them
    in-kernel.  conjecture1_proved = False. -/
def SegBandHyp (k : ℕ) : Prop :=
  ∀ i, i < segCount k → ∀ ρ : ℂ, (((1 / 4000000) : ℝ) ≤ ρ.re ∧ ρ.re ≤ (3999999 / 4000000)) →
    (segLo k i ≤ ρ.im ∧ ρ.im ≤ segHi k i) → riemannZeta ρ = 0 → ρ.re = 1 / 2

